          <span class="text-lg font-black text-white">TECHNO<span class="text-cyan-400">.</span></span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          Precision-engineered consumer technology hardware. Crafted with aerospace metals, audiophile acoustics, and high-efficiency GaN silicon.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-white tracking-wider mb-4">Categories</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#smartwatches" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Smartwatches</a></li>
          <li><a href="#headphones" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Over-Ear Headphones</a></li>
          <li><a href="#airbuds" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Airbuds &amp; Audio</a></li>
          <li><a href="#keyboards" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Mechanical Keyboards</a></li>
          <li><a href="#hardware" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Hardware &amp; Power</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-white tracking-wider mb-4">Assurance</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><span class="text-white">2-Year International Warranty</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-white">Worldwide Express Courier</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-white">30-Day Risk-Free Returns</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-white">Secure Encrypted Payments</span></li>
        </ul>
